msgctxt "text:fieldworkTravelEstimate.0"
msgid "At new/full moon, marker four does not count as reliable."
msgstr "朔／滿月的第四路標不計入可靠路標。"

#. fieldworkTravelEstimate.0
#: src/js/fieldwork-model.js:476
msgctxt "text:fieldworkTravelEstimate.0.2"
msgid "Night brooms detour around the patrol edge."
msgstr "夜間山區掃帚改走巡邏外緣。"

#. fieldworkTravelEstimate.0
#: src/js/fieldwork-model.js:481
msgctxt "text:fieldworkTravelEstimate.0.3"
msgid "Walking time excludes the stairs' disagreement over 'up'."
msgstr "步行時間不含階梯對『向上』的不同意見。"

#. fieldworkTravelEstimate.0
#: src/js/fieldwork-model.js:485
msgctxt "text:fieldworkTravelEstimate.0.4"
msgid "Underground broom airway is airborne only where there is airspace."
msgstr "地下掃帚空路只在有空的地方算空路。"

#. fieldworkTravelEstimate.0
#: src/js/fieldwork-model.js:489
msgctxt "text:fieldworkTravelEstimate.0.5"
msgid "Boundary passage is short; annex review uses ordinary time."
msgstr "境界通行很短；核對附件仍按普通時間。"

#. fieldworkTravelEstimate.0
#: src/js/fieldwork-model.js:492
msgctxt "text:fieldworkTravelEstimate.0.6"
msgid "Expected publication is nine minutes before arrival."
msgstr "預計新聞早於抵達九分鐘。"

